/apps/3228540/extras/d7b2a4ed5669b5211c7e984e10d51a6f.avif?t=1727981299\" width=618 height=93 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The newfound power of the Light gives Karl many abilities that some would deem unnatural. Will you talk with shadows and spirits or get an extra jump height to reach new places? Upgrade island level to unlock new resources? There are plenty of exciting choices to make. The world is yours. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb1 Gain XP from everything: foraging, crafting, defeating enemies gives you XP</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb1 Spend resources and craft items on the upgrade of the world-level</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb1 Access new areas and unlock new items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228540/extras/5b79a39c1c13f5a6164e865dde65d689.poster.avif?t=1727981299\" width=620 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228540/extras/5b79a39c1c13f5a6164e865dde65d689.webm?t=1727981299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228540/extras/dd00e9ba53d09f64bc62f2e28cef99a2.avif?t=1727981299\" width=618 height=170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228540/extras/06a140e63820f809ca1da7a610eb2ddc.poster.avif?t=1727981299\" width=620 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228540/extras/06a140e63820f809ca1da7a610eb2ddc.webm?t=1727981299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc3a JOIN US, THE NEW LIGHTKEEPER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We built this game with our fans. Join us to watch the game expand, playtest, and suggest your own ideas!</p>",
